type: software
title: "Cat Full-Body Neuromechanics: fixed-excitation forward dynamics"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-12
authors:
  - family-names: Rahmati
    given-names: Seyed Mohammadali
license: MIT
abstract: "A reproducible sagittal four-limb cat model with prescribed muscle excitation, activation dynamics, passive fiber force in all limbs, elastic tendons and compliant paw contact. Calibrated reference agreement and motor-input perturbation results are documented, with remaining biological and validation limitations."
keywords:
  - neuromechanics
  - forward dynamics
  - cat locomotion
  - elastic tendon
  - muscle excitation
